---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '<li>保险比较因旅行者而异';
const description = '你可以在中国使用外国信用卡吗？逼真的外观';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Can You Use Foreign Credit Cards in China?
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">现实地看看你的Visa或万事达卡在哪里工作。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>十几个短语会改变人们对待你的方式。</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-50 to-amber-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-orange-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>在中国，不要依赖实体信用卡作为主要付款方式。</strong> Foreign Visa/Mastercard works at international hotels, luxury malls, and airports — but most daily places (restaurants, taxis, shops) won't accept it. Use Alipay or WeChat Pay instead.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Let me be direct with you: <strong>在中国，不要依赖实体信用卡作为主要支付方式。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        I'我不是说它赢了't work. It will — in some places. But China'我们的支付生态系统是围绕二维码和移动应用程序构建的，而您的外国发行的Visa或万事达卡并不像您那样是该系统的一部分'd expect. Setting up <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">Alipay</a> or <a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">微信支付</a> is the smarter move.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💳</span> Where Your Foreign Card Actually Works
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">以下是真实的画面：</p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-green-800 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">✅ 是的，有效</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm text-green-700 space-y-1">
            <li>•国际连锁酒店（希尔顿、万豪、洲际）</li>
            <li>•高端百货商店和豪华商场</li>
            <li>•主要国际机场</li>
            <li>•一些国际餐厅</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-red-800 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">❌ 可能行不通</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm text-red-700 space-y-1">
            <li>•附近的餐馆和街头小吃摊</li>
            <li>•出租车和叫车服务（滴滴仅使用微信/支付宝）</li>
            <li>•当地商店、便利店、超市</li>
            <li>•只接受银联的任何地方（大多数地方）</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        The frustrating part is that many Chinese merchants have POS machines, but those machines are configured for <strong>银联</strong> — China's domestic card network. Your foreign Visa or Mastercard can't connect to the UnionPay network. So even when a terminal is sitting right there, your card might get declined.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏧</span> Using ATMs
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        ATMs are a different story. Most ATMs at Bank of China, ICBC, and China Construction Bank accept foreign Visa and Mastercard for cash withdrawals. The fees aren'不太好（通常每次取款15-30日元，加上您的银行's foreign transaction fee), but it works when you need cash.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💡</span> The Bottom Line
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700">带上你的信用卡作为备份，但要将移动支付设置为主要方式。你的旅行会顺利得多。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何在中国付款</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整的付款概览</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何设置支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">分步设置指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Sources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://cs.help.wechat.com/hc/en-us/articles/11975770896271-How-to-Set-Up-International-Cards-for-Weixin-Pay" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">微信-如何为微信支付设置国际卡</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>